amp;_nc_sid=8b3546&quot; height=&quot;1432&quot; width=&quot;1080&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; </description><link>https://www.instagram.com/p/DNlBVETMWtx/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.instagram.com/p/DNlBVETMWtx/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 20 Aug 2025 13:26:20 GMT</pubDate><author>stefaniejoosten</author></item><item><title>Cologne! I’m doing a signing session at Gamescom next week ✍️</title><description>Cologne! I’m doing a signing session at Gamescom next week ✍️&lt;br&gt;Bookings open on the Gamescom site 2 hours before. Can’t wait to see you there! #gamescom2025 #gamescomcreatorambassador &lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://scontent-sin11-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-15/531766312_18527326642056985_5456014930910665629_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&amp;amp;_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.cdninstagram.com&amp;amp;_nc_cat=101&amp;amp;_nc_oc=Q6cZ2QHznubau7GoYl6NVacH6g71hPcNYxlP_X1TsMB3kLnIqRgju4oyrr4PacJSmO8EHgc&amp;amp;_nc_ohc=MEehXCgQP7kQ7kNvwEz5XEN&amp;amp;_nc_gid=H6ZtSdI-7_h2JbRjKHVUYA&amp;amp;edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&amp;amp;ccb=7-5&amp;amp;oh=00_AfjR-AiL11pNlm--n9yZdT1aC9oT0nYr-FOP1prhtMGE9Q&amp;amp;oe=69329EE4&amp;amp;_nc_sid=8b3546&quot; height=&quot;1348&quot; width=&quot;1080&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; </description><link>https://www.instagram.com/p/DNV0o00so9O/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.instagram.com/p/DNV0o00so9O/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 14 Aug 2025 15:46:50 GMT</pubDate><author>stefaniejoosten</author></item><item><title>𝐖𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐝𝐛𝐞𝐫𝐨𝐞𝐦𝐝 𝐠𝐚𝐦𝐞-𝐚𝐜𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐞 𝐒𝐭𝐞𝐟𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐞 𝐉𝐨𝐨𝐬�...</title><description>𝐖𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐝𝐛𝐞𝐫𝐨𝐞𝐦𝐝 𝐠𝐚𝐦𝐞-𝐚𝐜𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐜𝐞 𝐒𝐭𝐞𝐟𝐚𝐧𝐢𝐞 𝐉𝐨𝐨𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐧&lt;br&gt;Vraag je @stefaniejoosten (36) wat ze precies doet, dan krijg je geen eenduidig antwoord. Ze is onder meer actrice, zangeres, model én wereldwijd bekend als personage in een populaire videogame - haar talent laat zich nu eenmaal niet vangen in één hokje. Inmiddels werkt ze vanuit Limburg aan projecten die haar van Japan tot de Verenigde Staten brengen. Deze veelzijdige carrière leidt de Roermondse in november zelfs naar de Royal Albert Hall in Londen. In het sfeervolle @kasteeltje_hattem spreekt Navenant Magazine met Stefanie over haar leven in Tokio, haar rol in de game-industrie en de provincie die voor haar altijd als thuis zal blijven voelen: Limburg.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lees meer: https://bit.ly/4eOxrAN&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#navenant #navenantmagazine #limburg #stefaniejoosten #gameactrice #games &lt;br&gt;Foto’s: @enriquemeesters.nl &lt;br&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://scontent-sin6-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-15/528053236_18364993945148710_3246262836837650607_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&amp;amp;_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.cdninstagram.com&amp;amp;_nc_cat=110&amp;amp;_nc_oc=Q6cZ2QHznubau7GoYl6NVacH6g71hPcNYxlP_X1TsMB3kLnIqRgju4oyrr4PacJSmO8EHgc&amp;amp;_nc_ohc=IUtmkPihGsIQ7kNvwH2YL3v&amp;amp;_nc_gid=H6ZtSdI-7_h2JbRjKHVUYA&amp;amp;edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&amp;amp;ccb=7-5&amp;amp;oh=00_AfglFWpg5H7s74HCSZb0B0kdcW2taNKumvaspME_jkNzQg&amp;amp;oe=6932A437&amp;amp;_nc_sid=8b3546&quot; height=&quot;1440&quot; width=&quot;1080&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;   &lt;img src=&quot;https://scontent-sin6-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-15/527465414_18364993954148710_9076861748419893261_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh0.08_tt6&amp;amp;_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.cdninstagram.com&amp;amp;_nc_cat=110&amp;amp;_nc_oc=Q6cZ2QHznubau7GoYl6NVacH6g71hPcNYxlP_X1TsMB3kLnIqRgju4oyrr4PacJSmO8EHgc&amp;amp;_nc_ohc=C8IvpMiJyS8Q7kNvwFTGYMj&amp;amp;_nc_gid=H6ZtSdI-7_h2JbRjKHVUYA&amp;amp;edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&amp;amp;ccb=7-5&amp;amp;oh=00_Afj-magsgvMUITMo5h6M5B7vAz0RKW1CeLCPoXXAk2FhpQ&amp;amp;oe=6932B6F0&amp;amp;_nc_sid=8b3546&quot; height=&quot;1440&quot; width=&quot;1080&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; </description><link>https://www.instagram.com/p/DM96AP8MQKG/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.instagram.com/p/DM96AP8MQKG/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 08:51:57 GMT</pubDate><author>navenantmagazine</a